### Add Motivational Content (POST)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/admin/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "You are worthy 💜",
  "body": "Rest if you must, but don’t quit.",
  "createdBy": "Gabriella"
}

### Get all motivational content
GET http://localhost:5001/api/admin/content

### Assign a mentor to student
POST http://localhost:5001/api/admin/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "E5lASReixsUPPbc9UBl9SL31rmU2",
  "mentorId": "8dJhrfKp8lcJBdqeMWXrnrvxEdM2",
  "assignedBy": "5iOmmLOJUdPKopLhwt8ASFX3QAp2"
}

### Get all assignments
GET http://localhost:5001/api/admin/assignments

### Notifications
POST http://localhost:5001/api/admin/notify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientId": "E5lASReixsUPPbc9UBl9SL31rmU2",
  "message": "You’ve been assigned a mentor!",
  "createdBy": "5iOmmLOJUdPKopLhwt8ASFX3QAp2"
}

### Admin Stats
GET http://localhost:5001/api/admin/stats

### Get unassigned students
GET http://localhost:5001/api/admin/users?role=student&assigned=false

### Promote user to mentor
PATCH http://localhost:5001/api/admin/users/USER_ID/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "mentor"
}

### Flag a user
POST http://localhost:5001/api/admin/users/USER_ID/flag
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flaggedBy": "ADMIN_USER_ID",
  "reason": "At-risk behavior"
}

### Save Mood Entry
POST http://localhost:5001/api/mood
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "v6zMQd74zrgYD8bX5ek3DGrwkFv2",
  "mood": "Happy",
  "emoji": "😄",
  "note": "Today I finally fixed the mood tracker bug!"
}

### Get all moods for user
GET http://localhost:5001/api/mood/v6zMQd74zrgYD8bX5ek3DGrwkFv2
